---
import Base from "@Layout/Base.astro";
import ContextEngine from "../Content/Mermaid/context-engine.svg?raw";
import HookChain from "../Content/Mermaid/hook-chain.svg?raw";
---

<Base
	Title="PLUGIN // APHRODITE"
	Description="The Aphrodite Hermes plugin, v2.2.6: a thin Python registration shim over a Rust dylib - 6 hooks, 13 tools, an opt-in context engine, and an explicit SHA-256-verified download flow."
>
	<main
		class="relative z-10 mx-auto flex w-full max-w-[1440px] flex-col gap-28 px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 lg:gap-44 lg:px-14 lg:py-32"
	>
		<!-- HERO -->
		<header class="relative flex w-full flex-col items-start">
			<div
				class="mb-6 -rotate-1 border border-black bg-raw-blood px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-bone-white shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#000]"
			>
				PLUGIN // THE THIN LOADER
			</div>
			<h1
				class="font-headline text-3xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-bone-white drop-shadow-[4px_4px_0px_#520612] sm:text-5xl"
			>
				The plugin
			</h1>
			<p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-bone-newsprint">
				Aphrodite ships as a Hermes Agent plugin: a thin Python registration shim over a
				Rust dylib. Six hooks, thirteen tools, and an opt-in context engine - all declared
				in <code class="font-mono text-xs text-weathered-teal">plugin.yaml</code>, all logic
				living in <code class="font-mono text-xs text-weathered-teal"
					>libaphrodite_hermes.dylib</code
				>. This page documents the v2.2.6 plugin spec.
			</p>
			<div class="mt-8 flex max-w-4xl flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
				<span
					class="-rotate-2 border-2 border-black bg-raw-blood px-4 py-1.5 font-mono text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-bone-white shadow-[4px_4px_0px_#000]"
				>
					v2.2.6 STANDALONE
				</span>
				<span
					class="rotate-1 border-2 border-black bg-carbon-void px-4 py-1.5 font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-weathered-teal shadow-[4px_4px_0px_#000]"
				>
					6 HOOKS
				</span>
				<span
					class="-rotate-1 border-2 border-black bg-carbon-void px-4 py-1.5 font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-weathered-teal shadow-[4px_4px_0px_#000]"
				>
					13 TOOLS
				</span>
				<span
					class="rotate-2 border-2 border-black bg-stamped-canary px-4 py-1.5 font-mono text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-soot-black shadow-[4px_4px_0px_#000]"
				>
					ZERO LOGIC IN PYTHON
				</span>
			</div>
		</header>

		<!-- PLUGIN.YAML FACTS -->
		<section class="relative w-full">
			<div
				class="mb-6 -rotate-1 border border-black bg-raw-blood px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-bone-white shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#000]"
			>
				plugin.yaml // THE DECLARED SURFACE
			</div>
			<div
				class="zine-box-crimson w-full -rotate-[1.2deg] border-4 border-blood-crimson bg-carbon-void p-8 transition-transform duration-300 hover:rotate-0 sm:p-12"
			>
				<h2 class="mb-6 font-headline text-lg font-black uppercase text-bone-white sm:text-xl">
					What the manifest declares
				</h2>
				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 md:grid-cols-2">
					<div class="space-y-2 border border-oxblood-dark bg-soot-black p-5 font-mono text-[12px]">
						<div><span class="text-zinc-dust">name:</span> <span class="text-bone-white">aphrodite</span></div>
						<div><span class="text-zinc-dust">version:</span> <span class="text-bone-white">2.2.6</span></div>
						<div><span class="text-zinc-dust">kind:</span> <span class="text-bone-white">standalone</span></div>
						<div>
							<span class="text-zinc-dust">requires_hermes:</span>
							<span class="text-stamped-canary">&gt;=0.20.2</span>
						</div>
						<div>
							<span class="text-zinc-dust">requires_hooks:</span>
							<span class="text-bone-white">true</span>
						</div>
						<div>
							<span class="text-zinc-dust">provides_context_engine:</span>
							<span class="text-bone-white">true</span>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="space-y-2 border border-oxblood-dark bg-soot-black p-5 font-mono text-[12px]">
						<div class="text-weathered-teal"># provides_hooks (6)</div>
						<div class="text-bone-newsprint">on_session_start · pre_tool_call</div>
						<div class="text-bone-newsprint">transform_tool_result · transform_terminal_output</div>
						<div class="text-bone-newsprint">pre_llm_call · post_llm_call</div>
						<div class="pt-3 text-weathered-teal"># provides_tools (13)</div>
						<div class="text-bone-newsprint">retrieve · compress · stats · rebuild · files · diff</div>
						<div class="text-bone-newsprint">search · directive · test · catalog</div>
						<div class="text-bone-newsprint">reclassify · prefetch · prefetch_status</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<p class="mt-6 border-t border-oxblood-dark pt-4 text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-zinc-dust">
					ENGINE THRESHOLD SEMANTICS: -1 = ALWAYS COMPRESS · 0 = DISABLED · &gt;0 = FILL
					PERCENT. SKILLS ARE NOT SHIPPED WITH THE PLUGIN - THEY LIVE DEV-SIDE.
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- ARCHITECTURE -->
		<section class="relative w-full lg:w-10/12 lg:self-end">
			<div
				class="zine-box-crimson relative rotate-[1.4deg] border-4 border-blood-crimson bg-carbon-void p-8 transition-transform duration-300 hover:rotate-0 sm:p-12"
			>
				<div
					class="absolute -top-4 left-6 border border-black bg-stamped-canary px-3 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-soot-black shadow-[2px_2px_0px_#000]"
				>
					ARCHITECTURE // CALL CHAIN
				</div>
				<h2 class="mb-6 mt-3 font-headline text-lg font-black uppercase text-bone-white sm:text-xl">
					A thin shim, a Rust brain
				</h2>
				<div class="space-y-0 border border-oxblood-dark bg-soot-black p-5 font-mono text-[12px] leading-relaxed">
					<div class="text-bone-white">Hermes Agent (hooks + tool dispatch)</div>
					<div class="pl-4 text-zinc-dust">│</div>
					<div class="pl-4 text-bone-newsprint">__init__.py - ctypes FFI, registers hooks/tools/engine · no logic</div>
					<div class="pl-4 text-zinc-dust">│</div>
					<div class="pl-4 text-stamped-canary">libaphrodite_hermes.dylib - Hermes bridge (JSON contract) · 6 hooks · 13 tools · schemas</div>
					<div class="pl-4 text-zinc-dust">│</div>
					<div class="pl-4 text-bone-newsprint">libaphrodite (core engine) - ALL compression logic: hooks · resolve · retrieve · marker · preview · directives</div>
					<div class="pl-4 text-zinc-dust">│</div>
					<div class="pl-4 text-weathered-teal">CCR store - SQLite :9798 / in-memory :9797 / inline</div>
				</div>
				<p class="mt-6 font-body text-xs leading-relaxed text-zinc-dust">
					Registration is driven by the dylib: the shim asks the dylib for its hook names
					and tool schemas and registers one callback per name. No hot-reload - the dylib
					is resolved once per process; to pick up a new build, restart the Hermes session.
				</p>
				<figure class="mt-10 border border-oxblood-dark bg-soot-black p-4" data-diagram="context-engine">
					<div class="overflow-x-auto" set:html={ContextEngine} />
					<figcaption class="mt-3 font-mono text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-dust">
						M9 // CONTEXT ENGINE
					</figcaption>
				</figure>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- DOWNLOAD FLOW -->
		<section class="relative w-full">
			<div
				class="mb-6 -rotate-1 border border-black bg-raw-blood px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-bone-white shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#000]"
			>
				DOWNLOAD // EXPLICIT STEPS ONLY
			</div>
			<div
				class="zine-box-crimson w-full -rotate-[1.4deg] border-4 border-blood-crimson bg-carbon-void p-8 transition-transform duration-300 hover:rotate-0 sm:p-12"
			>
				<h2 class="mb-6 font-headline text-lg font-black uppercase text-bone-white sm:text-xl">
					register() never downloads
				</h2>
				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2">
					<div>
						<p class="mb-4 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-bone-newsprint">
							Binaries are never shipped in the repository. Fetching them is an explicit
							setup step you run yourself - and the verification is mandatory, not
							best-effort:
						</p>
						<ul class="space-y-3 font-body text-sm text-bone-newsprint">
							<li class="border-l-4 border-raw-blood pl-4">
								<span class="font-bold text-bone-white">SHA-256 against the in-tree checksum list</span>
								- <code class="font-mono text-xs text-weathered-teal">SHA256SUMS.txt</code>,
								generated by CI into the tree; a mismatch is refused outright.
							</li>
							<li class="border-l-4 border-raw-blood pl-4">
								<span class="font-bold text-bone-white">Magic-byte validation</span> - the
								downloaded file must be a real ELF / Mach-O / PE image, or it is rejected.
							</li>
							<li class="border-l-4 border-raw-blood pl-4">
								<span class="font-bold text-bone-white">Backup + restore</span> - an
								existing install is backed up and restored if any step fails. No
								release-hosted fallback.
							</li>
							<li class="border-l-4 border-raw-blood pl-4">
								<span class="font-bold text-bone-white">A missing binary disables, not breaks</span>
								- the plugin logs the setup command and stays disabled until the binaries
								are present.
							</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
					<div>
						<div class="mb-5 space-y-2 border border-oxblood-dark bg-soot-black p-5 font-mono text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-zinc-dust">
							<div>$ git clone https://github.com/PlayForm/Aphrodite-Hermes.git</div>
							<div>$ cd Aphrodite-Hermes</div>
							<div>$ ln -s "$(pwd)" ~/.hermes/plugins/aphrodite</div>
							<div class="text-bone-white">$ bash download.sh <span class="opacity-40">// or: pwsh ./download.ps1</span></div>
							<div class="opacity-70">$ cd ..</div>
							<div class="text-bone-white">$ hermes plugins enable aphrodite</div>
							<div class="opacity-70">$ hermes</div>
						</div>
						<div
							class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-2 border-oxblood-dark bg-asphalt-panel p-4"
						>
							<span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-stamped-canary">
								COPY THE FULL SEQUENCE:
							</span>
							<button
								class="border border-black bg-raw-blood px-4 py-2 font-mono text-xs font-black uppercase text-bone-white shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#000] transition-colors hover:bg-blood-crimson active:translate-x-0.5 active:translate-y-0.5 active:shadow-none"
								data-copy={"git clone https://github.com/PlayForm/Aphrodite-Hermes.git\ncd Aphrodite-Hermes\nln -s \"$(pwd)\" ~/.hermes/plugins/aphrodite\nbash download.sh\ncd ..\nhermes plugins enable aphrodite\nhermes"}
							>
								COPY
							</button>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<p class="mt-6 border-t border-oxblood-dark pt-4 font-body text-xs leading-relaxed text-zinc-dust">
					LLM API KEY REQUIRED: the proxy is an OpenAI-compatible forwarder and needs its
					own credentials - <code class="font-mono text-xs text-weathered-teal">APHRODITE_API_KEY</code>,
					<code class="font-mono text-xs text-weathered-teal">aphrodite setup</code>, or
					<code class="font-mono text-xs text-weathered-teal">api_key</code> in
					~/.hermes/aphrodite/aphrodite.toml. Hermes' provider config is NOT reused, and
					there is no keyless mode: without a key the proxy refuses to start.
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- FILESYSTEM MAP -->
		<section class="relative w-full lg:w-9/12 lg:self-start">
			<div
				class="zine-box-crimson relative rotate-[1.2deg] border-4 border-blood-crimson bg-carbon-void p-8 transition-transform duration-300 hover:rotate-0 sm:p-12"
			>
				<div
					class="absolute -top-4 right-6 border border-black bg-weathered-teal px-3 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-bone-white shadow-[2px_2px_0px_#000]"
				>
					FILESYSTEM // CANONICAL LAYOUT
				</div>
				<h2 class="mb-6 mt-3 font-headline text-lg font-black uppercase text-bone-white sm:text-xl">
					What changes after install
				</h2>
				<div class="space-y-0 border border-oxblood-dark bg-soot-black p-5 font-mono text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-bone-newsprint">
					<div>~/.hermes/</div>
					<div class="pl-4">├── plugins/aphrodite <span class="text-zinc-dust">← manual symlink to the plugin repo</span></div>
					<div class="pl-4 text-bone-white">└── aphrodite/ <span class="text-zinc-dust">← runtime home</span></div>
					<div class="pl-10">├── binaries/aphrodite <span class="text-zinc-dust">← proxy binary, fetched + verified</span></div>
					<div class="pl-10">├── binaries/libaphrodite_hermes.dylib</div>
					<div class="pl-10">├── aphrodite.toml <span class="text-zinc-dust">← config</span></div>
					<div class="pl-10">├── directives/ <span class="text-zinc-dust">← 7 built-ins materialized</span></div>
					<div class="pl-10">├── ccr.db <span class="text-zinc-dust">← SQLite CCR store</span></div>
					<div class="pl-10">└── proxy-stderr.log <span class="text-zinc-dust">← proxy logs (empty = healthy)</span></div>
				</div>
				<p class="mt-6 font-body text-xs leading-relaxed text-zinc-dust">
					The runtime home self-heals toward
					<code class="font-mono text-xs text-weathered-teal">layout_schema.json</code> at
					startup: misplaced config and binaries are moved to their canonical paths, stale
					plugin-source copies are quarantined, and the
					~/.hermes/plugins/aphrodite install dir is Hermes-owned - the plugin never
					creates, converts, or modifies it.
				</p>
				<figure
					class="mx-auto mt-10 max-w-md border border-oxblood-dark bg-soot-black p-3"
					data-diagram="hook-chain-mini"
				>
					<div class="overflow-x-auto [&_svg]:h-auto" set:html={HookChain} />
					<figcaption class="mt-2 font-mono text-[9px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-dust">
						M3 MINI // HOOK CHAIN
					</figcaption>
				</figure>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- FOOTER -->
		<footer
			class="flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-6 border-t-2 border-oxblood-dark pb-6 pt-16 text-xs text-zinc-dust sm:flex-row"
		>
			<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
				<span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 bg-raw-blood"></span>
				<span class="font-bold tracking-widest text-bone-white uppercase">APHRODITE CCR CORE</span>
			</div>
			<div class="flex items-center gap-4">
				<a class="transition-colors hover:text-bone-white" href="/hooks/">HOOKS</a>
				<a class="transition-colors hover:text-bone-white" href="/tools/">TOOLS</a>
				<a class="transition-colors hover:text-bone-white" href="/hermes/">HERMES</a>
				<span class="font-bold text-stamped-canary">CC0-1.0</span>
			</div>
		</footer>
	</main>
</Base>
